:Namespace Orders
⍝ The demo's business logic: sample orders and running totals per region.
⍝ Plain APL with no Kafka calls, so it can be tested on its own.

    ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
    Regions←'North' 'South' 'East' 'West'
    Products←'Widget' 'Gadget' 'Doohickey' 'Gizmo'
    Prices←4.99 19.99 14.5 49

    ∇ o←{start}Make n;i
    ⍝ n sample orders (namespaces), numbered from start (default 1).
    ⍝ Deterministic, so runs and tests are repeatable.
      :If 0=⎕NC'start' ⋄ start←1 ⋄ :EndIf
      o←{
          m←⎕NS ⍬
          m.id←⍵
          m.region←Regions⊃⍨1+4|(3×⍵)+⌊⍵÷7
          m.product←Products⊃⍨1+4|(2×⍵)+⌊⍵÷5
          m.qty←1+19|(7×⍵)+⌊⍵÷4
          m.price←Prices⊃⍨1+4|(11×⍵)+⌊⍵÷6
          m
      }¨start+¯1+⍳n
    ∇

    ∇ s←Empty
    ⍝ A fresh state: one row per region, nothing counted yet.
      s←⎕NS ⍬
      s.region←Regions
      s.orders←0⍴⍨≢Regions
      s.revenue←0⍴⍨≢Regions
    ∇

    ∇ s←s Add orders;regions;amounts;i
    ⍝ Add a batch of orders to the running totals (returns a new state).
    ⍝ ⌸ (key) groups the batch by region; the totals are then added in.
      s←⎕NS s
      :If 0=≢orders ⋄ :Return ⋄ :EndIf
      regions←orders.region
      amounts←orders.(qty×price)
      i←s.region⍳∪regions
      s.orders[i]+←regions{≢⍵}⌸amounts
      s.revenue[i]+←regions{+/⍵}⌸amounts
      s.revenue←Cents s.revenue
    ∇

    ∇ t←Table s;o
    ⍝ The state as a table, biggest revenue first: region orders revenue
      o←⍒s.revenue
      t←s.region[o],s.orders[o],[1.5]s.revenue[o]
    ∇

    ∇ j←Summary s
    ⍝ The state as a namespace for JSON: {"total":…, "orders":…, "regions":[…]}
      j←⎕NS ⍬
      j.orders←+/s.orders
      j.total←Cents+/s.revenue
      j.regions←{r←⎕NS ⍬ ⋄ r.(region orders revenue)←⍵ ⋄ r}¨↓Table s
    ∇

    ∇ s←FromSummary j;r;i
    ⍝ Rebuild a state from a Summary (e.g. the last one read back from Kafka)
      s←Empty
      :For r :In j.regions
          i←s.region⍳⊂r.region
          s.orders[i]←r.orders
          s.revenue[i]←r.revenue
      :EndFor
    ∇

    Cents←{(⌊0.5+100×⍵)÷100}
:EndNamespace
